# Planners package — reusable planning/search components.
#
# Phase 0 scaffolding. See `docs/PLANNERS_PACKAGE.md` for the full plan.
#
# Sub-packages:
#   common      — shared value encoding, noise sampling, action bounds
#   tree_search — MCTS strategy traits (SearchMode, PUCT, Backup, ...)
#   trajectory  — CEMPlanner, MPPIPlanner, iLQR (filled in later phases)
#   testing     — stub world models + parity harness for isolated unit tests
